4. Fraud Detection: Banks and financial institutions can use streaming inference to analyze transactions in real-time, enabling them to quickly detect and prevent fraudulent activities.

5. Autonomous Vehicles: Self-driving cars can utilize streaming inference to analyze sensor data and make real-time decisions to ensure safety and optimal performance.

To achieve streaming inference, enterprises often need powerful cloud infrastructure that can handle real-time data analysis at scale, as well as optimized AI/ML models that can efficiently process streaming data.
