The results are much faster computation times since fewer operations are performed at the software level. This type optimization is often found in key mathematical computations like FFT (Fast Fourier Transform) and DCT (Discrete Cosine Transform) when processing digital images/signals or whilst performing MatMul lobes in scientific code.
